---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Starlight Sites"
  description="Free, rigorous study notes for IB, A-Level, GCSE, AP, DSE, university STEM, and programming."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">Free &amp; Open Source</div>
    <h1>Rigorous Study Notes<br><span>Without the Paywall</span></h1>
    <p>Free, comprehensive notes for IB, A-Level, GCSE, AP, DSE, university STEM, and programming. Written with undergraduate precision, designed for serious students.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="https://dse.wyattau.com/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Browse Notes
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
          <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/WyattAu/starlight-sites" class="btn btn-secondary">
        View on GitHub
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path>
          <path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-value">2,000+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Pages</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-value">9</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Sites</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-value">15+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Subjects</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-value">100%</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Free</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2>Exam Board Notes</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="site-grid" data-cols="3">
      <a href="https://dse.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>DSE</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">dse.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">Hong Kong Diploma of Secondary Education revision notes with worked examples and practice problems.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Mathematics</span>
          <span class="tag">Physics</span>
          <span class="tag">Chemistry</span>
          <span class="tag">Biology</span>
          <span class="tag">ICT</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://ib.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>IB</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">ib.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">International Baccalaureate Diploma Programme notes aligned to the IB curriculum framework.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Mathematics AA/AI</span>
          <span class="tag">Physics</span>
          <span class="tag">Chemistry</span>
          <span class="tag">Biology</span>
          <span class="tag">Computer Science</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://alevel.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>A-Level</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">alevel.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">UK A-Level revision notes covering multiple exam boards with detailed derivations.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Mathematics</span>
          <span class="tag">Further Maths</span>
          <span class="tag">Physics</span>
          <span class="tag">Chemistry</span>
          <span class="tag">Biology</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://qualifications.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" data-span="3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>Qualifications</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">qualifications.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">GCSE, AP, Scottish Highers, Irish Leaving Certificate, and other qualification notes.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">GCSE</span>
          <span class="tag">AP</span>
          <span class="tag">Scottish Highers</span>
          <span class="tag">Irish LC</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"></path>
          <path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"></path>
          <path d="m14.5 4-5 16"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2>University &amp; Programming</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="site-grid" data-cols="2">
      <a href="https://university.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>University</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">university.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">Rigorous, proof-based undergraduate STEM notes covering linear algebra, calculus, mechanics, and electromagnetism.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Linear Algebra</span>
          <span class="tag">ODEs</span>
          <span class="tag">Classical Mechanics</span>
          <span class="tag">Electromagnetism</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://programming.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>Programming</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">programming.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">Deep systems programming notes covering ownership, templates, concurrency, and build systems.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">C++</span>
          <span class="tag">Ownership/RAII</span>
          <span class="tag">Templates</span>
          <span class="tag">Concurrency</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 20h9"></path>
          <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2>Reference &amp; Tools</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="site-grid" data-cols="3">
      <a href="https://infrastructure.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" data-span="2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">infrastructure.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">Server administration, databases, networking, and security reference materials.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">TrueNAS</span>
          <span class="tag">Databases</span>
          <span class="tag">Linux</span>
          <span class="tag">Networking</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://languages.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>Languages</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">languages.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">Comparative programming language notes covering syntax, paradigms, and concurrency models.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Dart</span>
          <span class="tag">Go</span>
          <span class="tag">Java</span>
          <span class="tag">Kotlin</span>
          <span class="tag">Python</span>
          <span class="tag">Rust</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://tools.wyattau.com/" class="site-card" data-span="3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <div class="site-card-header">
          <h3>Tools</h3>
          <svg class="arrow" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="url">tools.wyattau.com</div>
        <div class="description">Algorithms, data structures, version control, and machine learning fundamentals.</div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Algorithms</span>
          <span class="tag">Data Structures</span>
          <span class="tag">Git</span>
          <span class="tag">Licensing</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2>Why These Notes?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card" data-accent="success">
        <h3>Rigorous &amp; Complete</h3>
        <p>Every definition is precise, every theorem is proved, every formula derived from first principles. No hand-waving, no shortcuts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card" data-accent="accent">
        <h3>Free &amp; Open Source</h3>
        <p>AGPLv3 licensed. No fees, no ads, no tracking. Source code available on GitHub for contributions and corrections.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card" data-accent="info">
        <h3>Syllabus-Aligned</h3>
        <p>Written to official exam specifications. Derivations included. No filler content that won't appear in exams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card" data-accent="warning">
        <h3>Cross-Referenced</h3>
        <p>Concepts linked across subjects and levels. Search across all sites from any page using Cmd+K.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
